<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>13-Alexandra Fusai (France)/Rita Grande (Italy) beat Shirli-Ann</p>
<p>Siddall (Britain)/Amanda Wainwright (Britain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium)/Ginger Helgeson Nielsen (U.S.) beat Anke</p>
<p>Huber (Germany)/Monica Seles (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>1-Gigi Fernandez (U.S.)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat</p>
<p>Catherine Barclay (Australia)/Clare Wood (Britain) 7-5 7-5</p>
</text>
